==Strategy==
This is a pretty simple stage combining Deathkory and Golem Sunfish with two Shadow Boxer Ks as "support". Given that you can stall out the enemies before you hit the base, feel free to do so to make sure you don't fight any more Shadow Boxer Ks than you need to.

The easiest way to beat this stage is to spam [[Pied Piper Cat (Rare Cat)|Brass Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]. While Octopus makes sure Deathkory's Waves can't do much, Brass can land needed Shield Pierces and Weaken whatever's left of his Waves. As a bonus, they also have a similar move speed, meaning that it shouldn't be hard to mess this up. The two Shadow Boxer Ks can be easily killed with [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|Awakened Doron]] or whatever Wave Immune attacker you brought, like a Talented [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]] or [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]]. From there, [[Maize Cat (Rare Cat)|Maize Cat]] can wall Deathkory and Golem Sunfish for comedic lengths of time, and you can just spam your Wave Immune units to chip down the Deathkory and beat the stage.

